  {
   "i": 1,
   "tipo": "GUIA",
   "titulo": "Lista de materiales",
   "html": "<div class=\"contentWrapper-0-4-688\"><div class=\"contentEditable-0-4-689 contentEditable-d7-0-4-989 root-0-4-693 vmIc3WzjxMkUf+6rJDBJLA==\" contenteditable=\"true\" id=\"editor-content-editable\" role=\"textbox\" spellcheck=\"true\" style=\"user-select: text; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\" data-lexical-editor=\"true\"><h3 class=\"editor-heading editor-h3\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Materiales para tu retrato en funda </strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">📱 </span></h3><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">¡Ya casi empezamos con este proyecto súper creativo!</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Asegúrate de tener todos tus materiales listos para que puedas fluir sin interrupciones 💖</span></p><ul class=\"editor-ul-depth-1\"><li value=\"1\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Funda de celular de acrigel</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> (transparente o blanca de preferencia)</span></li><li value=\"2\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pinceles de punta redonda</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> #4 y #10</span></li><li value=\"3\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Plumón permanente</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> (punta fina o media)</span></li><li value=\"4\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pinturas acrílicas:</strong><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Blanco</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Negro</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Rojo</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Amarillo</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Naranja</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Azul ultramar</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">— Sombra café</span></li><li value=\"5\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Godete</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> para mezclar tus colores</span></li><li value=\"6\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Toallita o papel</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> para secar tus pinceles</span></li><li value=\"7\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Vasito con agua</strong></li></ul><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Prepara tu espacio, pon tu playlist favorita y nos vemos en la siguiente lección para comenzar a pintar.🖌️</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p></div><div class=\"tableCellActionButtonContainer-0-4-750\"></div><div class=\"blockTargetLine-0-4-778\"></div><div id=\"block-actions\" class=\"blockActionsMenu-0-4-772\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate(-10000px, -10000px);\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"root-0-4-59 root-d12-0-4-1011 blockAddAction-0-4-773\" data-testid=\"block-add-action-button\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.add\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M6 12h12M12 18V6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" draggable=\"true\" class=\"blockDragAction-0-4-777\" data-testid=\"BlockOptionsActionPlugin.DraggableBlock\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.reorder\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpG